  "learnings": [
    "Initial generation uses Specmatic v3 runOptions nested under service references, matching the Enterprise runtime guidance in this skill.",
    "Product creation maps to the REST /products dependency and publishes the AsyncAPI product audit message to product-queries.",
    "The local verification environment runs OpenJDK 17, so the sample targets Java 17 while keeping Spring Boot 3.5.3.",
    "Jackson scalar coercion is disabled and request bodies are explicitly type-checked so negative OpenAPI tests that mutate fields return the contract-declared 400 response.",
    "The BFF contract marks GET /orders as WIP and does not define a 4xx response for invalid orderId. Specmatic reports those generated scenarios as WIP/aborted, not failures.",
